# Your account is closed

It is scheduled for permanent deletion on **<%= @scrub_date.to_date.to_fs(:long) %>**. Until then, you can restore it.

- On the deletion date, your profile is anonymized and your access is permanently removed. Content you shared stays, attributed to "Deleted User".
- If you have a prepaid balance, it is forfeited on the deletion date — not before.
- Your API tokens were revoked when the account was closed. After restoring, issue new tokens.
- Restoring re-enables your automations and your agents.

To restore: POST to `/account/closure/restore`.
